---
const repo = 'https://github.com/0xHelico/helico'
const faqs = [
	{
		q: 'What is Helico?',
		a: 'A vault that keeps a Uniswap v4 liquidity position in range under rules the user commits to once: range width, how much liquidity a move must keep, a cooldown, an improvement floor, an expiry. A Chainlink CRE confidential workflow decides when to move; the vault checks every rule on chain before anything happens.',
	},
	{
		q: 'What stays confidential?',
		a: 'The decision process: which positions the enclave watches, when it reads the pool, the RPC traffic, and how it sizes the swap and the mint. The mandate itself is public on chain; its hash in every report proves the enclave decided against the terms the vault holds, not stale ones.',
	},
	{
		q: 'Can the agent take my funds?',
		a: 'No path in the vault pays an agent. A re-centre burns your position, swaps only what the burn returned, and mints the new range back to you; the only addresses it writes into the plan are yours and the pool\'s. A rogue agent can move you inside your own terms, and nothing else.',
	},
	{
		q: 'Which chain does it run on?',
		a: 'Arbitrum One, where Uniswap v4 and a Chainlink CRE forwarder both exist. The plugins resolve any chain from config; the tests ran real transactions on Base Sepolia and Robinhood Chain and fork tests on Arbitrum.',
	},
	{
		q: 'Is it live?',
		a: 'Not yet. The vault has a rehearsed deploy script, the workflow runs in the CRE simulator, and the enclave\'s signature path is proven end to end in tests. A production enclave needs the Confidential Workflows beta; until then the simulator stands in for it, and this page says so.',
	},
]
---

<section class="container faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
	<h2 id="faq-title" class="sr-only">Frequently asked questions</h2>
	<div class="faq__list">
		{faqs.map((f) => (
			<details class="faq__item">
				<summary>
					<span>{f.q}</span>
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14" /><path d="M5 12h14" /></svg>
				</summary>
				<p>{f.a}</p>
			</details>
		))}
	</div>
	<p class="faq__more"><a href={`${repo}#readme`}>Learn more about Helico ↗</a></p>
</section>

<style>
	.faq {
		margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
	}
	.sr-only {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.faq__list {
		max-width: 44rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.faq__item {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11, 14, 21, 0.08);
	}
	.faq__item summary {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		list-style: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.faq__item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
		display: none;
	}
	.faq__item summary svg {
		width: 1rem;
		height: 1rem;
		color: #5d4ce6;
		transition: transform 0.2s;
	}
	.faq__item[open] summary svg {
		transform: rotate(45deg);
	}
	.faq__item p {
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #5b6270;
		max-width: 40rem;
	}
	.faq__more {
		text-align: center;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
	.faq__more a {
		color: #4c3fd6;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
</style>
